                "difficulty": "hard",
                "question": "<p>The rate of change,\r                             <img src=\"images/fd67c9e592cd40b6b0eb88eeb465c1d2.png\" class=\"exam-img\" style=\"max-width:100%; vertical-align:middle; margin:4px 0;\">, of the number of people entering\r                             an auditorium for a concert is modeled by\r                             a logistic differential equation. The\r                             capacity of the auditorium is 1,600. At\r                             6:30 pm the number of people in the\r                             auditorium is 400 and is increasing at\r                             a rate of 600 people per hour. Which of the following differential equations describes the situation?</p>",
